Copyright 2026 fullmetalsonic and RoamADB contributors

This technical spike contains original RoamADB source plus package dependencies
resolved by Gradle, NuGet, and the .NET SDK. QRCoder is linked under the MIT
License. Google Code Scanner is called through Google Play services. Tailscale,
LADB, AOSP adb, and scrcpy source code is not included in the repository.
The Windows installer is generated with Inno Setup; Inno Setup itself is not
redistributed in this repository.
